Package: biostatlab
Title: Curated Datasets for Biostatistics Labs and Benchmarks
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Imad", family = "El Badisy", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "elbadisyimad@gmail.com")
Author: Imad El Badisy [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Imad El Badisy <elbadisyimad@gmail.com>
Description: Hosts documented datasets for biostatistics teaching labs and
    modelling benchmarks. The package includes a task registry so users can
    discover datasets suitable for regression, classification, and survival
    analysis workflows.
